{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 29, :comments ["<b>Any devoted thing that is devoted, etc.</b> One who is going out to be executed and said, 'My valuation is upon me' — he has said nothing (Sifra; Arakhin 6)." "<b>Shall surely be put to death.</b> He is going to death; therefore he is not redeemed — he has neither money-value nor valuation."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:08:59.631095789Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}